1a:T7fe,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Product","@id":"https://batteriq.com/bluetti/bluetti-ac200pl#product","name":"BLUETTI AC200PL","url":"https://batteriq.com/bluetti/bluetti-ac200pl","image":["https://batteriq.com/products/bluetti/bluetti-ac200pl.jpg"],"description":"The Bluetti AC200PL is a powerhouse with 2048Wh LFP capacity and 2400W AC output. Expandable to 8192Wh with up to four B300S batteries. The go-to solution for whole-home backup in Kenya.","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"BLUETTI"},"category":"Power Stations","sku":"BLUETTI-AC200PL","additionalProperty":[{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Usb C","value":"2 x USB-C 100W"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Weight","value":"28.1kg"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Capacity","value":"2304Wh"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Ups Mode","value":"Yes (<20ms)"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Warranty","value":"24 months"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Ac Output","value":"2400W (Surge 4800W)"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Tt30 Port","value":"Yes (RV port)"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Ac Outlets","value":"4 AC outlets"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Cycle Life","value":"3500+ cycles"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Expandable","value":"Yes — up to 8448Wh"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Ac Charging","value":"2400W Turbo, 0-80% in ~1 hr"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"App Control","value":"Yes (Wi-Fi & Bluetooth)"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Solar Input","value":"1200W Max (dual MPPT)"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Battery Type","value":"LFP"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Power Lifting","value":"Up to 3600W"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Wireless Charging","value":"2 x Qi pads"}],"offers":{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://batteriq.com/bluetti/bluetti-ac200pl","priceCurrency":"KES","price":125000,"priceValidUntil":"2027-11-16","itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","seller":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://batteriq.com/#organization","name":"Batteriq"}}}1b:T7b0,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much is the Bluetti AC200PL in Kenya?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Bluetti AC200PL costs KES 125,000 at Batteriq, Kenya's authorised BLUETTI dealer. You can pay instantly with M-Pesa or by Visa/Mastercard at checkout. It is covered by a 24-month warranty."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the Bluetti AC200PL available in Nairobi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — the Bluetti AC200PL is in stock and ready to ship. We deliver across Nairobi and ship nationwide to all 47 counties, and you will get an official eTIMS KRA invoice with your order."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can the Bluetti AC200PL keep my home running during a KPLC blackout?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — that is what it is designed for. It stores 2304Wh in a long-life LFP battery and delivers 2400W (Surge 4800W). Runtime depends on what you connect, so send us your appliance list on WhatsApp and we will size it for you. It is covered by a 24-month warranty."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What can the BLUETTI AC200PL run in a Kenyan home?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"With 2,304 Wh, the BLUETTI AC200PL can run a fridge (150 W) for approximately 13 hours, a TV (100 W) for approximately 20 hours, a Wi-Fi router (15 W) for approximately 131 hours and lights (50 W) for approximately 39 hours, each on its own. These are approximate (capacity × 0.85 ÷ watts). Keep the total load under its 2400W (Surge 4800W) AC output. Send us your appliance list on WhatsApp and we will size it for you."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which solar panels work with the BLUETTI AC200PL?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The BLUETTI AC200PL has a solar input of 1200W Max (dual MPPT). Choose panels within that limit; message us on WhatsApp with the model and we will confirm the right panels and cables before you buy."}}]}20:{"size":20}
